      "note": "Apply package is always CV + cover letter + a real company Profile. Qualifying live evidence is HTTP 2xx AND a company/slug marker in the body. Local HTML or SPA 200 empty shell is not enough. R3 independently re-runs claim-lock, slop, skip-language, and waiver on current files. Disk ACCEPT reports cannot waive content gates."
    },
